# Allowlist: the image is built from the package source only. Everything else
# (data/, docs/, tests/, examples/, .git, local corpora) stays out of the build
# context, so nothing personal can reach the image whatever lands in a checkout.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
src/baselayer/archive/
src/baselayer/experiments/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
